#: kstart.cpp:172
msgid "Command to execute."
msgstr "opdrag aan uitvoer."

#: kstart.cpp:174
msgid ""
"A regular expression matching the window title.\n"
"If you do not specify one, then the very first window\n"
"to appear will be taken. Not recommended!"
msgstr ""
"'n gewone uitdrukking ooreenstemmende die venster titel.\n"
"as jy doen nie spesifiseer een, dan word die baie eerste venster\n"
"aan verskyn sal wees geneem. nie aanbeveel!"

#: kstart.cpp:177
msgid "Desktop where to make the window appear. "
msgstr "werkskerm waar aan maak die venster verskyn. "

#: kstart.cpp:178
msgid ""
"Make the window appear on the desktop that was active\n"
"when starting the application. "
msgstr ""
"maak die venster verskyn op die werkskerm wat was aktief\n"
"wanneer beginne die aansoek. "

#: kstart.cpp:179
msgid "Make the window appear on all desktops"
msgstr "maak die venster verskyn op alle werkskerms"

#: kstart.cpp:180
msgid "Iconify the window"
msgstr "ikoonifiseer die venster"

#: kstart.cpp:181
msgid "Maximize the window"
msgstr "maksimeer die venster"

#: kstart.cpp:182
msgid ""
"The window type: Normal, Desktop, Dock, Tool, \n"
"Menu, Dialog or Override"
msgstr ""
"die venster tipe: normale, werkskerm, vasmeer, program, \n"
"kieslys, dialoog of oorskryf"

#: kstart.cpp:183
msgid ""
"Jump to the window even if it is started on a \n"
"different virtual desktop"
msgstr ""
"spring aan die venster al as dit is beginne op 'n \n"
"ander virtuele werkskerm"

#: kstart.cpp:185
msgid "Make the window always stay on top of any other window"
msgstr "maak die venster altyd bly op bo van enige ander venster"

#: kstart.cpp:186
msgid "The window does not get an entry in the taskbar"
msgstr "die venster doen nie kry 'n inskrywing in die kasbar"

#: kstart.cpp:187
msgid "The window does not get an entry on the pager"
msgstr "die venster doen nie kry 'n inskrywing op die boodskapper"

#: kstart.cpp:188
msgid "The window is sent to the system tray in Kicker."
msgstr "die venster is gestuur aan die stelsel laai in kicker."

#: kstart.cpp:195
msgid "KStart"
msgstr "kstart"

#: kstart.cpp:196
msgid ""
"Utility to launch applications with special window properties \n"
"such as iconified, maximized, a certain virtual desktop, a special "
"decoration\n"
"and so on."
msgstr ""
"program aan lanseer programme met spesiaal venster eienskappe \n"
"soos as geïkonifiseer, maksimeerd, 'n sekere virtuele werkskerm, 'n "
"spesiaal versiering\n"
"en sodat op."

#: kstart.cpp:216
msgid "No command specified"
msgstr "nee opdrag gespesifiseer"

